# The fourth plan counter need not come from Political Triumph's own trigger: any counter put on it counts (CR 122.6).
# With three plan counters on it, Bot1 casts Tezzeret's Gambit on turn 3 and proliferates the enchantment (CR 701.34a):
# its fourth plan counter is put, so it is sacrificed once the Gambit has resolved, and Bot1 draws a third card (the
# Mountain, after the Gambit's Island and Swamp) and puts a +1/+1 counter on each of its three Ornithopters.

